WEBVTT

01:44.050 --> 01:45.700
100 meter freestyle.

01:51.160 --> 01:57.470
Umisho earned victory after victory as if yesterday's terrible performance was a fluke.

01:57.470 --> 01:59.320
Hey!

02:06.850 --> 02:10.730
Orizuka-senpai beat her average record time,

02:10.730 --> 02:12.860
which means she's going to the inter-high tournament!

02:12.860 --> 02:17.200
Orizuka-senpai and Amuro-senpai are both off to a great start!

02:17.550 --> 02:19.240
Kaname-chan, the promise!

02:20.530 --> 02:22.410
You forgot already?!

02:22.410 --> 02:26.990
You promised to do anything I tell you if I win an event in the Kantou tournament.

02:26.990 --> 02:28.260
Yeah, yeah.

02:28.260 --> 02:30.400
Reward, reward!

02:31.230 --> 02:33.300
Hey, no running on the pool deck!

02:38.300 --> 02:41.340
I wonder what Ninagawa is going to ask you to do.

02:42.300 --> 02:46.060
She seems to like you, so she might want a kiss.

02:46.640 --> 02:47.560
A kiss?!

02:51.660 --> 02:55.650
Kaname-chan, let me have the reward...

02:56.450 --> 02:57.470
Amuro...

02:58.580 --> 02:59.610
I got it.

02:59.610 --> 03:01.670
A promise is a promise.

03:12.710 --> 03:13.550
No way!

03:13.550 --> 03:15.380
Amuro is not that type of girl!

03:15.500 --> 03:21.520
If I win, I'm going to ask Shizuoka-san to do this and that.

03:29.180 --> 03:30.400
Your chest...

03:30.400 --> 03:31.610
It's nice, it's nice.

03:46.240 --> 03:48.350
Mold, mold, mold.

03:50.660 --> 03:51.970
Sigh...

03:51.970 --> 03:54.540
Shizuoka-san has nothing to do with this!

03:54.540 --> 03:57.460
You're not in this tournament to begin with!

03:57.460 --> 04:00.870
We are comrades that have been swimming in the same pool!

04:00.870 --> 04:04.970
Even if I'm not swimming today, my heart is swimming with Shizuoka-san!

04:13.020 --> 04:14.530
I-I got it.

04:14.530 --> 04:15.980
Don't get so worked up.

04:16.230 --> 04:19.980
Let's win the preliminaries as well!

04:20.360 --> 04:23.190
Makio would like to participate on this kicking board, too!

04:23.190 --> 04:25.700
There's another one getting all worked up.

04:25.700 --> 04:26.390
Let's do it!

04:26.390 --> 04:27.300
Yeah!

04:29.620 --> 04:33.260
The cheering is more energetic than usual since this is the Kantou tournament.

04:42.500 --> 04:45.350
Comrades that have been swimming in the same pool, huh?

04:46.880 --> 04:50.960
Hey, hey, all the people over there are just like Makio-chan.

04:52.280 --> 04:54.300
That's Tamatsuka Academy.

04:54.300 --> 04:56.690
I think they're in the same medley relay preliminaries.

04:56.690 --> 04:57.560
What?!

04:57.560 --> 04:58.440
Are they rivals?!

04:58.990 --> 05:01.160
Then, I'll go meet them!

05:01.160 --> 05:02.190
Hey!

05:03.120 --> 05:06.040
Everyeone, make sure you cheer really loud.

05:06.040 --> 05:06.700
Right!

05:07.010 --> 05:08.950
Good morning!

05:08.950 --> 05:11.710
I'm Ninagawa Amuro from Umisho.

05:11.710 --> 05:13.510
We're in the same medley relay group.

05:13.510 --> 05:14.770
Nice to meet you...

05:14.770 --> 05:16.710
even though Amuro won't be swimming.

05:17.060 --> 05:21.210
You're Ninagawa Amuro, participating in the 50 meter and 100 meter freestyle, right?

05:21.560 --> 05:22.630
I know you.

05:22.630 --> 05:24.290
I saw you back there.

05:24.290 --> 05:26.330
You swim very well.

05:27.600 --> 05:28.720
You're embarrassing me.

05:29.240 --> 05:34.000
And I like active girls like you.

05:36.900 --> 05:38.960
You're not participating in the medley relay?

05:38.960 --> 05:40.630
That's too bad.

05:41.190 --> 05:43.030
She's cool... and cute.

05:43.030 --> 05:44.940
She definitely looks fast.

05:44.940 --> 05:46.700
She's a wonderful sight even though she's an enemy.

05:49.300 --> 05:51.910
I can't get enough of that tanned butt.

05:55.540 --> 05:57.460
Are we allowed to swim freely?

06:19.890 --> 06:21.110
I'm sorry.

06:28.940 --> 06:30.080
You're that girl.

06:30.080 --> 06:31.120
We meet again.

06:40.130 --> 06:42.130
Remember? I'm Amuro from Umisho.

06:43.020 --> 06:44.670
I don't know you.

06:45.070 --> 06:46.590
Why are you running away?

06:46.590 --> 06:47.940
Wait!

06:47.940 --> 06:49.240
What is she doing?

06:49.240 --> 06:50.220
Are they friends?

06:52.960 --> 06:55.720
I wonder why she didn't talk to me.

06:56.140 --> 06:58.730
What are you talking about?

06:59.080 --> 07:01.870
You just have to grab it, and he's toast!

07:03.610 --> 07:06.190
Some girl I don't know heard me!

07:07.340 --> 07:09.650
She was just at the pool.

07:10.220 --> 07:12.700
That's weird.

07:15.760 --> 07:17.210
Are you okay?!

07:20.640 --> 07:21.990
I'm sorry.

07:21.990 --> 07:23.000
I didn't do it on purpose.

07:23.530 --> 07:25.000
You're that girl again!

07:25.410 --> 07:27.390
I really didn't do it on purpose!

07:27.390 --> 07:28.980
It's not my fault, right?!

07:28.980 --> 07:29.720
Run!

07:34.240 --> 07:37.710
Now, it's the start of the medley relay!

07:37.710 --> 07:44.850
Girls' medley relay, third lane, Kanagawa Umineko Shougyou High School team.

07:44.850 --> 07:47.380
Nanako-san, did something happen?

07:47.380 --> 07:49.380
You were so depressed last night.

07:49.380 --> 07:51.740
She seems really motivated.

07:52.090 --> 07:55.280
This is a group effort, so don't slow me down.

07:57.580 --> 07:58.790
You sure are confident.

07:59.850 --> 08:04.590
Fourth lane, Saitama Tamatsuka Academy team.

08:07.420 --> 08:08.800
It's that girl.

08:09.150 --> 08:11.300
Mimi, I'll leave the start to you.

08:13.830 --> 08:14.800
Yeah.

08:15.350 --> 08:17.310
Those two look the same.

08:17.850 --> 08:20.240
Those two are twins.

08:20.240 --> 08:22.020
No, you're wrong.

08:27.130 --> 08:28.020
Chu, chu.

08:29.030 --> 08:30.510
Quadruplets?!

08:31.210 --> 08:32.070
They've found out!

08:32.070 --> 08:33.280
They've found out that we're quadruplets!

08:36.980 --> 08:38.490
Are you serious?

08:38.890 --> 08:41.290
So there were four of them.

08:45.290 --> 08:47.290
Hi, hi.

08:48.750 --> 08:51.380
Nice to meet you guys from Umisho.

08:55.480 --> 08:57.390
So what if they're quadruplets?

08:57.740 --> 08:59.480
Mimi, do it!

08:59.480 --> 09:00.100
Yeah.

09:00.450 --> 09:03.600
There's no way you can beat Maaya when she's hot.

09:03.950 --> 09:05.400
It's about to start!

09:05.520 --> 09:07.600
Do it!

09:07.600 --> 09:10.430
Captain, you came just now?!

09:10.430 --> 09:12.120
I overslept.

09:12.120 --> 09:14.110
My race is tomorrow anyway.

09:14.920 --> 09:19.490
Plus, you're dressed like you're on vacation.

09:19.490 --> 09:20.330
Vacation.

09:20.330 --> 09:24.130
Vaca-- Vaca-- Vaca-- Vaca-- Vaca-- Vacation.

09:24.130 --> 09:25.370
Yes, yes.

09:26.830 --> 09:29.590
What's that stick?

09:30.100 --> 09:31.090
Ready.

09:38.760 --> 09:39.610
All right!

09:39.610 --> 09:41.770
Maaya-san got a perfect start!

09:52.780 --> 09:55.370
Umisho is already in first place!

09:55.370 --> 09:58.620
Tamatsuka isn't as fast as I thought they were.

09:59.540 --> 10:00.620
No,

10:03.630 --> 10:05.120
she's starting to gain speed!

10:05.470 --> 10:07.440
She's already in second place!

10:07.440 --> 10:10.130
Such precise movement.

10:09.800 --> 10:13.170
It's as if she's in rhythm with a song!

10:10.540 --> 10:15.240
On the widespread sea

10:15.240 --> 10:17.770
Like a fish,

10:17.770 --> 10:22.520
Sparkling splashing water.

10:20.790 --> 10:22.520
They're really singing!

10:22.990 --> 10:26.640
A place for eternity.

10:26.640 --> 10:30.690
Feel the sea breeze.

10:30.690 --> 10:34.640
Go beyond the rainbow.

10:34.640 --> 10:38.610
Kick the waves freely.

10:38.990 --> 10:42.660
Go with bravery.

10:40.620 --> 10:42.660
Singing...

10:42.660 --> 10:50.790
Forever, forever, it will be our ocean.

10:48.750 --> 10:50.790
Swimming...

10:50.790 --> 10:58.700
The memory is true and beautiful, maidens.

10:58.700 --> 11:06.730
Until everyone's power is drained.

11:02.020 --> 11:03.970
They're completely synchronized!

11:05.040 --> 11:09.520
This is the Synchronized Medley Relay Melody Swimming Technique!

11:06.730 --> 11:14.480
With this wind, friends, our dreams, and hopes.

11:09.520 --> 11:13.200
In other words, S.M.M.S.!

11:13.200 --> 11:14.480
What?!

11:14.480 --> 11:18.700
We are Tamatsuka Academy.

11:18.700 --> 11:27.000
We are worthy of the star of water.

11:45.630 --> 11:47.560
She caught up at the turn.

11:47.560 --> 11:49.020
What's with her?

11:49.020 --> 11:53.770
She's moving like a machine, without breaking her pace or messing up her form.

11:53.770 --> 11:54.620
Damn it!

11:54.620 --> 11:55.270
I won't lose!

11:58.130 --> 11:59.780
Here she comes.

12:00.130 --> 12:02.780
My shoulders feel so stiff today.

12:02.780 --> 12:05.030
Damn it!

12:09.490 --> 12:11.240
They started at the same time!

12:14.120 --> 12:17.120
They were only 0.02 seconds from a new high school record!

12:20.550 --> 12:22.910
I definitely can't lose now.

12:22.910 --> 12:24.670
I don't care about my individual race anymore.

12:24.670 --> 12:25.760
I'll make sure I get it to the next person,

12:25.760 --> 12:28.830
Our ocean.

12:26.420 --> 12:28.830
but she sure is fast.

12:28.830 --> 12:36.190
The memory is true and beautiful, maidens.

12:28.830 --> 12:31.020
She's starting to increase her lead!

12:31.830 --> 12:34.400
The effect of the S.M.M.S. is tremendous!

12:35.140 --> 12:36.190
All right,

12:36.190 --> 12:39.080
then all we have to do is sing, too!

12:40.030 --> 12:47.370
The Japanese restaurant in front of the station.

12:47.370 --> 12:50.450
Ikariya.

12:48.780 --> 12:50.450
What is that song?

12:50.780 --> 12:55.460
We just have to sing about stuff we like.

12:55.810 --> 13:04.180
Then, fish, fish, I want to eat it.

12:55.810 --> 13:03.230
The Japanese restaurant in front of the station.

13:00.970 --> 13:04.180
The white lighthouse's...

13:03.230 --> 13:06.680
Ikariya.

13:06.680 --> 13:09.560
Shizuoka-san is up next.

13:13.560 --> 13:16.270
Mayo, widen the gap!

13:16.790 --> 13:24.530
On top of the things heating up for first place, there's a lot of the same faces, and I'm feeling dizzy.

13:24.530 --> 13:26.740
Ikariya!

13:24.530 --> 13:26.740
Kise-san is still with her!

13:32.630 --> 13:39.800
Maaya-san and Kise-senpai are doing so well... What if I ruin it?

13:40.150 --> 13:41.470
N-No!

13:41.470 --> 13:42.650
I...

13:44.640 --> 13:45.800
I can't...

13:48.550 --> 13:50.220
M-Maaya-san?!

13:51.060 --> 13:53.930
What's the point of you feeling down now?

13:55.430 --> 13:58.080
It's not over even if we lose, right?

13:58.080 --> 13:59.730
Take it easy.

14:02.960 --> 14:03.740
Yes.

14:04.090 --> 14:08.280
My, when did our teamwork become this good?

14:08.280 --> 14:11.940
Even if they pass you, the old hag swimming last will do something about it.

14:11.940 --> 14:12.700
Hey!

14:22.100 --> 14:25.130
I have to help everyone!

14:27.920 --> 14:32.430
Tamatsuka is in the lead, and Umisho is right behind them by two seconds.

14:32.780 --> 14:35.140
Mirei-san is catching up rapidly!

14:36.950 --> 14:40.150
The blue ocean's...

14:40.490 --> 14:44.360
Amuro, Amuro, Amuro.

14:44.870 --> 14:48.900
One and a half mugs of beer.

14:48.900 --> 14:51.640
Do your best, Shizuoka-san.

14:51.640 --> 14:55.760
My heart is swimming with you.

14:55.760 --> 14:59.130
Shizuoka-san and I are one body and one mind.

14:59.130 --> 15:03.630
Ikariya!

15:01.330 --> 15:03.630
We should sing together.

15:05.530 --> 15:08.130
At the turn, Umisho is neck and neck with Tamatsuka.

15:08.130 --> 15:09.220
Shizuoka.

15:09.220 --> 15:10.140
We might be able to do it!

15:10.140 --> 15:14.640
Banana, banana, I want to eat some!

15:10.140 --> 15:14.640
Beautiful, Umisho!

15:15.540 --> 15:17.390
What's with them?

15:26.410 --> 15:28.810
They're catching up!

15:29.280 --> 15:31.110
We definitely won't lose.

15:38.370 --> 15:40.370
Orizuka-senpai was late starting!

15:44.980 --> 15:46.380
This girl is fast.

15:48.620 --> 15:50.380
There's something wrong with my leg.

15:50.380 --> 15:51.890
Geez, of all times!

15:53.890 --> 15:55.890
The girl's pulling away from Zuka.

15:55.890 --> 16:01.280
We are Umisho!

15:55.890 --> 16:01.280
Oma, oma, oma, oma, oma!

15:55.890 --> 16:01.280
Ikariya!

16:01.790 --> 16:02.630
What should we do?

16:02.630 --> 16:04.330
Our song ended.

16:04.330 --> 16:06.280
Let's sing another song.

16:06.280 --> 16:09.160
This one is perfect!

16:09.160 --> 16:13.610
The star of water.

16:10.080 --> 16:13.610
It's the Ono Island dance song!

16:12.290 --> 16:13.610
What is that?

16:20.450 --> 16:25.500
At the cape of Ono Island.

16:25.860 --> 16:27.380
Why do I have to do this?

16:27.380 --> 16:30.510
That is the treasure of the island.

16:28.250 --> 16:30.510
The captain even took his pants off.

16:30.510 --> 16:32.190
You idiot!

16:32.190 --> 16:34.010
Dance songs are for people to go wild with their pants off!

16:34.580 --> 16:36.020
But...

16:36.020 --> 16:38.510
Here we go!

16:38.510 --> 16:45.020
Ono Island dance song!

16:42.330 --> 16:45.020
We're gonna cause trouble for them.

16:45.540 --> 16:47.950
They're slowly getting closer.

16:49.700 --> 16:51.030
Hey, what's going on?

16:51.030 --> 16:52.530
No!

16:53.480 --> 16:56.030
I can see something from his crotch!

16:56.470 --> 16:59.030
Tamatsuka has the lead at the 50 meter turn.

17:03.190 --> 17:05.040
There's something wrong with the rhythm.

17:05.040 --> 17:12.050
That is the treasure of the island.

17:12.400 --> 17:14.550
No, what is that?

17:14.170 --> 17:14.550
No.

17:14.550 --> 17:15.320
I'm scared!

17:15.320 --> 17:17.050
Mommy!

17:41.580 --> 17:42.870
What's wrong?

17:42.870 --> 17:44.080
The singing stopped.

17:44.610 --> 17:46.410
Their pace is messed up.

17:46.410 --> 17:47.790
Go!

17:47.790 --> 17:49.750
Now's our chance. Here we go!

17:51.200 --> 17:52.810
Twenty more meters!

17:52.810 --> 17:55.050
Please, hold on!

17:57.390 --> 17:59.260
Please...

18:05.230 --> 18:06.480
Who won?!

18:10.450 --> 18:12.190
Umisho is first!

18:12.590 --> 18:14.210
We did it!

18:15.290 --> 18:15.900
Yep, yep!

18:23.160 --> 18:24.820
You did it, Zuka.

18:24.820 --> 18:25.910
You were amazing...

18:25.910 --> 18:27.530
Even though you're an old hag.

18:37.330 --> 18:38.680
Orizuka-senpai!

18:45.050 --> 18:47.190
Orizuka-senpai.

18:49.540 --> 18:50.560
She's awake.

18:52.090 --> 18:53.430
Where am I?

18:56.190 --> 18:58.220
Don't move your leg.

18:58.220 --> 18:59.840
You're at the infirmary.

18:59.840 --> 19:03.200
You got a cramp, but you swam through it.

19:04.360 --> 19:05.770
What about the medley relay?!

19:05.770 --> 19:07.660
Did I... in the middle of it...?

19:08.110 --> 19:10.710
We got first place and safely made it past the preliminaries.

19:13.420 --> 19:17.670
We backed you up by singing the Ono Island dance song.

19:18.630 --> 19:20.890
Ono Island dance song?

19:22.240 --> 19:24.100
No, never mind him.

19:24.550 --> 19:26.770
But, Orizuka-senpai...

19:29.190 --> 19:32.270
It's about the medley relay finals...

19:33.590 --> 19:34.770
And you are?

19:35.170 --> 19:37.060
This is Doctor Ganaha.

19:37.060 --> 19:39.280
You won't be able to swim with that leg.

19:41.870 --> 19:43.410
You'll have to forfeit.

19:43.410 --> 19:44.920
No way!

19:55.680 --> 19:57.130
She's awake.

19:57.560 --> 19:59.770
Here, I bought you some bananas.

19:59.770 --> 20:02.120
Eat a lot and feel better.

20:05.360 --> 20:06.890
I'll swim.

20:15.200 --> 20:17.430
We came this far.

20:18.030 --> 20:21.970
I can't let everyone down.

20:24.240 --> 20:25.820
I don't want that.

20:31.780 --> 20:36.060
But if you do anything rash right now, your leg will never...

20:36.060 --> 20:38.360
It'll be all right if I take a little break.

20:38.950 --> 20:41.630
I don't want to give up.

20:41.630 --> 20:45.390
I don't need for you to say something vague like, "It'll be all right!"

20:45.390 --> 20:47.640
Who's being vague?!

20:47.990 --> 20:49.260
Stop it.

20:49.260 --> 20:51.640
Maaya knows it well.

20:58.760 --> 21:02.340
Please stop fighting!

21:02.770 --> 21:03.980
That's right.

21:03.980 --> 21:06.620
It's too early to give up.

21:06.620 --> 21:12.670
If a regular member for the medley relay is hurt, you are allowed to have four alternates!

21:12.670 --> 21:15.890
But who'll take Orizuka-senpai's place?

21:17.350 --> 21:19.100
Could it be Makio?!

21:19.100 --> 21:20.880
No, that's impossible.

21:22.030 --> 21:25.090
At times like this, it's great to have friends.

21:26.960 --> 21:29.950
I'll swim in place of Orizuka-senpai!

21:29.950 --> 21:32.150
Why do you have a girl's bathing suit?!

21:32.150 --> 21:35.640
I got an extra one from the guy from Moroboshi Sports.

21:36.250 --> 21:40.060
Even if you wear that, people will know that you're a man right away.

21:40.610 --> 21:41.690
You're right.

21:42.050 --> 21:42.680
So...

21:42.680 --> 21:44.390
Then, how about this?!

21:46.440 --> 21:49.020
I look so sexy.

21:51.390 --> 21:56.670
No, only the girls that have been registered as swimmers can participate.

21:56.670 --> 21:59.210
Is that so?

21:59.570 --> 22:02.720
So Amuro, you have to swim in the finals.

22:02.720 --> 22:03.420
Finals?

22:06.380 --> 22:08.180
Me?

22:08.180 --> 22:10.680
You're the only one.

22:12.750 --> 22:13.830
Sure.

22:13.830 --> 22:16.230
I'll swim in place of Orizuka-senpai.

22:21.050 --> 22:22.690
All right, it's decided.

22:22.690 --> 22:25.320
Since Amuro-chan is freestyle just like Zuka.

22:31.350 --> 22:36.290
We will become one, for Orizuka-senpai.

22:38.040 --> 22:42.800
I don't want to swim with the X-girl, but there's no choice.

22:49.110 --> 22:50.870
I'll leave it to you guys.

22:50.870 --> 22:52.560
Here we go, Umisho!

22:52.560 --> 22:53.560
Yeah!

23:08.750 --> 23:12.280
And now the stage is set for the medley relay finals.

24:47.000 --> 24:50.410
Now it's the finals for the medley relay at the Kantou tournament!

24:50.410 --> 24:53.910
Let's combine the Umisho swim team's powers and go to the inter-highs!

24:53.910 --> 24:55.350
Maaya, do your best!

24:55.350 --> 24:57.220
Kise-senpai, do your best!

24:57.220 --> 24:59.050
Captain, what are you doing?!

24:59.050 --> 25:01.020
Shizuoka-san, no...

25:02.510 --> 25:04.150
At this rate...

25:04.150 --> 25:07.360
Next time on Kenkou Zenrakei Suieibu Umisho:

25:07.360 --> 25:09.530
Final episode, "Mermaid"

25:10.050 --> 25:12.040
Amuro's wish is...
